      "v": 1,
      "zh": "到了七月，以色列人住在各城；那时他们如同一人，聚集在耶路撒冷。",
      "en": "When the seventh month arrived and the Israelites[NOTE:1] were living[NOTE:2] in their[NOTE:3] towns, the people assembled[NOTE:4] in[NOTE:5] Jerusalem.[NOTE:6]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “the sons of Israel.”",
        "The word “living” is not in the Hebrew text, but is implied. Some translations supply “settled” (cf. NAB, NIV, NLT).",
        "The translation reads with some medieval Hebrew MSS and ancient versions בְּעָרֵיהֶם (beʿarehem, “in their towns”), rather than the reading בֶּעָרִים (beʿarim, “in the towns”) found in the MT. Cf. Neh 7:72 HT [7:73 ET].",
        "The Hebrew text adds the phrase “like one man.” This has not been included in the translation for stylistic reasons.",
        "Heb “to.”",
        "For location see Map5-B1; Map6-F3; Map7-E2; Map8-F2; Map10-B3; JP1-F4; JP2-F4; JP3-F4; JP4-F4."
