    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "约萨达的儿子耶书亚和他的弟兄众祭司，并撒拉铁的儿子所罗巴伯与他的弟兄，都起来建筑以色列　神的坛，要照神人摩西律法书上所写的，在坛上献燔祭。",
      "en": "Then Jeshua the son of Jozadak[NOTE:1] and his priestly colleagues[NOTE:2] and Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and his colleagues[NOTE:3] started to build[NOTE:4] the altar of the God of Israel so they could offer burnt offerings on it as required by[NOTE:5] the law of Moses the man of God.",
